    "detailed_description": "<strong>&quot;Whale Fall&quot;</strong> is a single-player exploration game where you control various marine creatures to experience the magnificent cycle of life in the vast ocean. <br><br> From deep-sea organisms to schools of fish and even massive whales, everything can be controlled by the player. <br> Through the story, let's experience the magnificent cycle of life in the vast ocean.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483030/extras/7e0fdb3b275f9225cefa0829d5cc2a56.avif?t=1689033380\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-Whale Fall-</strong></h2><i> After the death of a whale, its body sinks deep into the silent depths of the ocean.<br> This whale's body becomes a source of nourishment, giving birth to countless lives and forming a thriving ecosystem.<br> This is the <strong>Whale Fall</strong>, a community of organisms sustained by the whale's remains.</i><br><br> This story begins amidst such a Whale Fall.<br> Within the whale's bones, countless marine organisms have formed colonies, and the player emerges as a scavenger among them.<br> From the deep and serene ocean floor, the player sets out on a journey to the vast and abundant realm of marine life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483030/extras/2f04bf2db53b1aa1826beb030e91f8de.avif?t=1689033380\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Interactive Cinematic Experience</strong></h2> This game is an art piece created by a graduate student from Tokyo University of the Arts.<br> It offers the opportunity to explore a beautiful, mystical, and awe-inspiring underwater world at your own pace.<br> The game intentionally avoids displaying any user interface elements, focusing instead on delivering a truly immersive and realistic marine experience.<br><br> Furthermore, most scenes in the game are composed in a single continuous shot, allowing for a seamless gameplay experience.<br> It aims to create a sense of immersion akin to watching a movie, making you forget that you are playing a game.<br><br> All the music and sound design have been composed and created by students from the Music Department at Tokyo University of the Arts.<br><br><br><u> With their magnificent music and captivating visual experience, immerse yourself in a grand journey and narrative set in the majestic world of the ocean.</u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483030/extras/5c6b13d33ac6b5cc4606b45641744e5c.avif?t=1689033380\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483030/extras/9e1c9a4eb2753df994354b457870bae2.avif?t=1689033380\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483030/extras/f966325a52d2efbe6b80c46aa337ffb4.avif?t=1689033380\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483030/extras/c80b1301d57c724f0f0e9bce41b6dc9f.avif?t=1689033380\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>&quot;Whale Fall&quot;</strong> is a single-player exploration game where you control various marine creatures to experience the magnificent cycle of life in the vast ocean. <br><br> From deep-sea organisms to schools of fish and even massive whales, everything can be controlled by the player. <br> Through the story, let's experience the magnificent cycle of life in the vast ocean.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483030/extras/7e0fdb3b275f9225cefa0829d5cc2a56.avif?t=1689033380\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-Whale Fall-</strong></h2><i> After the death of a whale, its body sinks deep into the silent depths of the ocean.<br> This whale's body becomes a source of nourishment, giving birth to countless lives and forming a thriving ecosystem.<br> This is the <strong>Whale Fall</strong>, a community of organisms sustained by the whale's remains.</i><br><br> This story begins amidst such a Whale Fall.<br> Within the whale's bones, countless marine organisms have formed colonies, and the player emerges as a scavenger among them.<br> From the deep and serene ocean floor, the player sets out on a journey to the vast and abundant realm of marine life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483030/extras/2f04bf2db53b1aa1826beb030e91f8de.avif?t=1689033380\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Interactive Cinematic Experience</strong></h2> This game is an art piece created by a graduate student from Tokyo University of the Arts.<br> It offers the opportunity to explore a beautiful, mystical, and awe-inspiring underwater world at your own pace.<br> The game intentionally avoids displaying any user interface elements, focusing instead on delivering a truly immersive and realistic marine experience.<br><br> Furthermore, most scenes in the game are composed in a single continuous shot, allowing for a seamless gameplay experience.<br> It aims to create a sense of immersion akin to watching a movie, making you forget that you are playing a game.<br><br> All the music and sound design have been composed and created by students from the Music Department at Tokyo University of the Arts.<br><br><br><u> With their magnificent music and captivating visual experience, immerse yourself in a grand journey and narrative set in the majestic world of the ocean.</u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483030/extras/5c6b13d33ac6b5cc4606b45641744e5c.avif?t=1689033380\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483030/extras/9e1c9a4eb2753df994354b457870bae2.avif?t=1689033380\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483030/extras/f966325a52d2efbe6b80c46aa337ffb4.avif?t=1689033380\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483030/extras/c80b1301d57c724f0f0e9bce41b6dc9f.avif?t=1689033380\" /></span>",
